{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"41000109056","bookName":"Nadie se Mete con Mamá (Doblado)","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x1/41x0/410x0/41000113301/41000113301.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":156811256,"followCount":4030286,"introduction":"Mónica, una madre soltera que ha trabajado arduamente, enfrenta múltiples dificultades. Con su fuerza, logra criar a tres hijos que alcanzan grandes logros en sus respectivos campos. En el 70° cumpleaños de su padre, recibe una llamada de su madre que le pide que regrese a casa. Sin embargo, al llegar, es constantemente humillada por sus hermanas y su propio padre. A pesar de todo, Mónica supera todas las adversidades, encontrando nuevamente el amor y la felicidad.","chapterCount":100,"labels":["Family Bonds","Strong Female Lead"],"tags":["Family Bonds","Strong Female Lead"],"typeTwoIds":[336],"typeTwoNames":["Contraataque"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":336,"name":"Contraataque","replaceName":"contraataque"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Contraataque","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Crowned-in-Love-The-Mother-of-Three-Big-Shots-DUBBED","bookNameLower":"crowned-in-love-the-mother-of-three-big-shots-dubbed","shelfTime":"2025-03-11 14:36:48","firstShelfTime":"2025-03-11 14:36:48","performerList":[{"performerId":"19467","performerName":"Meixi Liu","performerFormatName":"Meixi-Liu","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/7x6/19467/19467.jpg?time=1781779580358","videoCount":3},{"performerId":"22978","performerName":"Shuai Xue","performerFormatName":"Shuai-Xue","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/8x7/22978/22978.jpg?time=1779449349577","videoCount":2}],"performerIdList":[19467,22978]},"chapterList":[{"id":"584175480","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/01/1x0/10x3/103x3/10331100014/588910210_1/588910210.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795219200&Signature=thApj9wmv9d66aC3iFsjzeRBXv3qW7bX0Q8HWPirwd7aYuhlzR6t85XyZrDDtSU6lJBX4q96nuy1GsM